{
  "name": "list_runs",
  "domain": "run",
  "description": "List the runs recorded in this workspace, newest first: evidence-ledger runs and root wrapped-agent sessions in one cursor-paged list, with the operator, the model, the machine, status, counts and metered cost each row recorded. The in-app agent's own turns are not listed.",
